        "text": "<thinking> To complete the task, I need to create a Python script that retrieves recent log results filtered by field values and time range using a concrete external provider. I will use the Datadog API for this task, as it is a well-known service for log management and analytics. The script will import the Datadog API client and use it to fetch logs based on the specified filters. </thinking>\n",
