      "data": {
        "text": "<thinking> To create the file `query_error_logs.py` in the current working directory, I need to write a Python script that integrates with a concrete external provider to query recent error log entries filtered by severity and time range. I will use the AWS CloudWatch service for this task, as it is a concrete external provider that allows querying log data. The script will use the `boto3` library to interact with AWS CloudWatch, which will make the provider identifiable in the code. </thinking>\n",
